== go build ./cmd/sbcap ==

== go run ./cmd/sbcap --help ==
Usage:
  sbcap [command]

Available Commands:
  chromedp-probe Run a minimal chromedp probe against a URL
  compare        Compare a single element between two URLs (screenshots + CSS + pixel diff)
  completion     Generate the autocompletion script for the specified shell
  help           Help about any command
  run            Run sbcap capture and analysis modes

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for sbcap

Use "sbcap [command] --help" for more information about a command.

== go run ./cmd/sbcap compare --help ==
Compare a single element between two URLs (screenshots + CSS + pixel diff)

Usage:
  sbcap compare [flags]

Flags:
      --attrs string       Comma-delimited attributes to capture (default: id,class) (default "id,class")
  -h, --help               help for compare
      --out string         Output directory (default: ./sbcap-compare-YYYYMMDD_HHMMSS)
      --props string       Comma-delimited CSS properties to compare (default: a curated list)
      --selector1 string   CSS selector for URL1 element
      --selector2 string   CSS selector for URL2 element (defaults to selector1)
      --threshold int      Pixel diff threshold (0-255) (default 30)
      --url1 string        First URL to compare
      --url2 string        Second URL to compare
      --viewport-h int     Viewport height (default 720)
      --viewport-w int     Viewport width (default 1280)
      --wait-ms1 int       Wait after navigation for URL1 (ms)
      --wait-ms2 int       Wait after navigation for URL2 (ms)
      --write-json         Write compare.json (default true)
      --write-markdown     Write compare.md (default true)
      --write-pngs         Write screenshots and diff images (default true)

